  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can maximize the benefits of your small size.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Low Profile<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain a +1 dodge bonus to AC against ranged attacks. This stacks with the bonus from Low Profile. In addition, you can choose whether or not you count as occupying a space when enemies and allies try to move through the space, make ranged attacks against adjacent foes, and determine whether or not you provide soft cover to creatures when ranged attacks pass through your square.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc212\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
